# Contact form delivery.
#
# The site is a static React build, so it cannot receive email by itself. It posts
# the enquiry to a hosted form service instead. You do not need to write or host a
# backend: pick one service below, paste its values here, rename this file to
# ".env", and restart the dev server.
#
# Check each service's current free-tier limits before you commit to one.

# --- Option A: Web3Forms (no account needed, key is emailed to you) -----------
# VITE_ENQUIRY_ENDPOINT=https://api.web3forms.com/submit
# VITE_ENQUIRY_ACCESS_KEY=your-access-key-here

# --- Option B: Formspree (create a form, paste its endpoint) ------------------
# VITE_ENQUIRY_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/your-form-id
# (leave VITE_ENQUIRY_ACCESS_KEY unset)

# --- Option C: FormSubmit (endpoint is your own address) ----------------------
# VITE_ENQUIRY_ENDPOINT=https://formsubmit.co/ajax/you@anwincorporation.com
# (leave VITE_ENQUIRY_ACCESS_KEY unset)

# Note: VITE_ prefixed values are compiled into the public JavaScript bundle and
# are readable by anyone. That is fine for these form keys, which are designed to
# be public. Never put a private API key or a database credential in here.
